      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "素材を手に入れてくれたのか！？\n流石は僕が後継者に見込んだ人間だ！\nさあ「踊姫の首飾り」を受け取ってくれ。\n良き後継者に巡り会えて、最高の気分だよ。",
        "official_en": "You've acquired the materials! I knew you were a\nworthy successor! Now, take the dancer's necklace.\nAhhh, what a relief to have found someone to take\nmy mantle.",
